   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the <b>pork belly</b> into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> pieces. Fry it in the <b>sesame oil</b> over high heat until it browns, about 2 minutes.</li><li>Add the squeezed <b>kimchi</b> and fry 1 minute more, until the pan is dry. Wet kimchi soaks the rice and the onigiri falls apart. Let it cool.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
