  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Chop the <b>takana</b> finely and squeeze out as much liquid as you can.</li><li>Fry it in the <b>sesame oil</b> with the <b>chilli</b> over medium-high heat for <b>2–3 minutes</b>, add the <b>soy</b> and cook until dry. Stir in the <b>sesame seeds</b>.</li></ul>",
