  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Toast the <b>peanuts</b> in a dry pan over medium-low heat until fragrant, 2–3 minutes.</li><li>Stir the <b>miso</b>, <b>sugar</b>, <b>mirin</b> and <b>water</b> together, pour it over the peanuts and stir over low heat until the miso turns glossy and clings to every nut, <b>2 minutes</b>.</li><li>Spread on a plate to cool. It sets sticky; break it up before using.</li></ul>",
